    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="60">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 60</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa teoðinge forhealde 7 he sy cyninges þegn, gilde X healfmarc, landagende VI healfmarc, ceorl XII ór.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone withholds tithes and he is a king's thegn, he is to pay 10 half-marks; a landowner [is to pay] six half-marks, a ceorl 12 ores.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone holds back his tithes and he is a king's thegn, his is to pay ten half-marks, a landholder six half-marks, a peasant twelve ores.</ab>
      </div>
